      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.19,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.19
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "我想哭，我想哭！！！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.71,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.45,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.44,
      "browInnerUp": 0.4,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.17,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.17
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "饿的想哭，想睡睡不着！！！那我真哭了！！！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.71,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.43,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.46,
      "browInnerUp": 0.42,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.18
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "亲爱的~我们会用我们的爱为你拭干所有悲伤！我知道你很难过~哦~~~",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.76,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.45,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.49,
      "browInnerUp": 0.45,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.17,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.2
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "现在我真的好想回深圳。只有家人会给我最温暖的抱抱，不让我难过，伤心。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.69,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.45,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.41,
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.18,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.15
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我也很伤心。。。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.62,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.41,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.37,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "0"
  },
  {
    "text": "阿根廷。我想哭。",
    "emotion": "sad",
