    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.41,
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.14,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.16
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "其实我还是蛮伤心的。。。。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.63,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.42,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.37,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.17,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "女流忙转世了？。:我想哭啊！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.66,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.44,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.39,
      "browInnerUp": 0.36,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.18,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "我家狗宝宝得狗瘟了！好伤心啊！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.68,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.45,
      "browInnerUp": 0.41,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.18
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "希望不要寒冷我只是觉得悲伤。晚安。",
