    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.42,
      "browInnerUp": 0.39,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.16
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "不睡满12个小时我怎么全身难受！！！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.64,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.43,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.38,
      "browInnerUp": 0.36,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.17,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "离开真的这么难吗？！我郁闷的头疼！！！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.65,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.41,
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.16
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "我郁闷了~咋就是弄不好呢！！！！！！！！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.68,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.45,
      "browInnerUp": 0.41,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.18
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "好多低落的情绪，难过。期盼心情晴天的到来。你们都要保佑我。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.63,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.41,
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.14,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.16
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "0"
  },
  {
    "text": "我难受...啊啊啊啊啊。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.56,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.35,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.36,
      "browInnerUp": 0.34,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.13,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "我好想去洗头啊好想去啊...一天不洗头就难受。",
