    "intensity": 0.57,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.34,
      "browInnerUp": 0.32,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.12
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "好难受啊我，头晕脑胀。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.57,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.34,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.38,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.12,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.15
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "哇难过太惨了我就想XXX！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.6,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.35,
      "browInnerUp": 0.33,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.13
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "你怎么这么难哄哒？我好累啊！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.59,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.35,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.4,
      "browInnerUp": 0.36,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.12,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.16
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "我怎么刚看到这个消息！难过！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.63,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.41,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.38,
      "browInnerUp": 0.36,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "好累好累啊。我想睡觉睡觉睡觉。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.57,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.37,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.35,
      "browInnerUp": 0.33,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.14,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.13
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "好累好累好累啊，丢。我要放假啊~！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.6,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.36,
      "browInnerUp": 0.34,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.13
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "我在为自己的能力买单！真的好累啊！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.62,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.38,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "我好累啊！我们都活的简单点不好么？",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.58,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.35,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.39,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.13,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.15
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "我觉得自己没有走错方向，可是好累。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.56,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.37,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.34,
      "browInnerUp": 0.32,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.14,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.13
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "老婆在加班，我就只能被加班。郁闷。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.56,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.33,
      "browInnerUp": 0.32,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.12
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "如果你能让我不疲惫，我愿和你一起飞~",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.58,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.36,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.37,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.13,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "张大初用的手机竟然是71，我郁闷啊！",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.59,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.37,
      "browInnerUp": 0.34,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "1"
  },
  {
    "text": "我对冷空气过敏，两个鼻孔痒得难受。。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.57,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.36,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.36,
      "browInnerUp": 0.34,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.14,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    },
    "source": "weibo_mined",
    "source_label": "2"
  },
  {
    "text": "偶滴个神啊~让不让我活了啊，难受的咧~",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.6,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.36,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.4,
